title: "Rh(211) Higher-Alcohol-Synthesis Microkinetic Model"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: MIT

authors:
  - family-names: Arevalo
    given-names: Ryan
  - family-names: Nakanishi
    given-names: Hiroshi

repository-code: "https://github.com/ryanlarevalo/Rh211-HAS-MKM"

keywords:
  - microkinetic modeling
  - higher alcohol synthesis
  - syngas
  - Rh(211)
  - density functional theory
  - catalysis
  - ethanol
  - reaction kinetics

abstract: >
  Python implementation and machine-readable data for the first-principles
  microkinetic analysis of higher alcohol synthesis from syngas on Rh(211).
  The repository contains the steady-state microkinetic model, temperature-
  pressure scan, degree-of-rate-control analysis, net reaction-flux analysis,
  reaction-order and apparent-activation-energy calculations, model inputs,
  and archived numerical validation datasets.
